title: Move Aura inherent checks into block import
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Moves Aura inherent verification from `AuraVerifier` into the new `AuraBlockImport`
    wrapper so that inherent data provider creation happens during block import. Aura import
    queue construction now takes `slot_duration` separately from the inherent data providers.

crates:
- name: sc-consensus-aura
  bump: major
- name: cumulus-client-consensus-aura
  bump: major
- name: polkadot-omni-node-lib
  bump: patch
